{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_EC443CAC","title":"Sanna - stay or go","entry":"Dlg_EC443CAC::entry","exit":"Dlg_EC443CAC::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_2527D986","articyId":"72057645577612873","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"Still here. And so are you.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Still here. And so are you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":625.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37945","byteOffset":28689856,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_8591B2DC","articyId":"72057645577613005","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"So... I guess you want to know what I decided.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So... I guess you want to know what I decided.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1225.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41161","byteOffset":29899464,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_48430FFB","articyId":"72057645577613019","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"I... decided I don't need her. I'm... better off alone. I'm going to Luna.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I... decided I don't need her. I'm... better off alone. I'm going to Luna.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2125.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21698","byteOffset":16098496,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_40462CC9","articyId":"72057645577613025","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"I'm going back to give it another shot. I think we can fix things. She can fix me. And I can fix her.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm going back to give it another shot. I think we can fix things. She can fix me. And I can fix her.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2125.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47327","byteOffset":32240504,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_3A3FE1DE","articyId":"72057645577613058","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"Well this might sound weird but... it was because of you. I mean not JUST you. Other friends helped too. But I really had some great people who listened and got me through this. And one of those people was you.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well this might sound weird but... it was because of you. I mean not JUST you. Other friends helped too. But I really had some great people who listened and got me through this. And one of those people was you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26496","byteOffset":17904536,"byteLength":520}},{"id":"DFr_696687F8","articyId":"72057645577613065","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"No, but I really didn't connect with anyone else like I did with her. Friends, family... they weren't really there for me. I didn't find... that support to get me on my feet again. So maybe she can do that.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No, but I really didn't connect with anyone else like I did with her. Friends, family... they weren't really there for me. I didn't find... that support to get me on my feet again. So maybe she can do that.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37046","byteOffset":28357152,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_E1DAF265","articyId":"72057645577613079","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"I'll move in. Help her look after her mom. I'm working now, so I can look after all of us. I guess we all settle in together. Settle for each other.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'll move in. Help her look after her mom. I'm working now, so I can look after all of us. I guess we all settle in together. Settle for each other.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3325.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50910","byteOffset":33599408,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_247562CF","articyId":"72057645577613093","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"Thanks. I think we... I wish we were closer. But anyway... thanks.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thanks. I think we... I wish we were closer. But anyway... thanks.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3925.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34368","byteOffset":20885176,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_544B04DE","articyId":"72057645577613108","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"Not all the time. And not all your advice was good. But you showed up. You let me moan, complain. You listened, but you didn't let me feel sorry for myself. That was what I needed.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not all the time. And not all your advice was good. But you showed up. You let me moan, complain. You listened, but you didn't let me feel sorry for myself. That was what I needed.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3325.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35778","byteOffset":27882616,"byteLength":560}},{"id":"DFr_734689E3","articyId":"72057645577613135","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"Yeah.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3925.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38275","byteOffset":28815688,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_D98FED40","articyId":"72057645577613141","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"I did MOST of it myself. But no one gets through a breakup without a friend or two.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I did MOST of it myself. But no one gets through a breakup without a friend or two.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3925.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47394","byteOffset":32266248,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_5DE1F8B9","articyId":"72057645577613146","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"Me too.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Me too.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3925.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20469","byteOffset":15626592,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_89928AC5","articyId":"72057645577613166","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"As soon as the LUZ flight ban lifts. Even after the LUZ is gone, shuttles will take a while to start up again. But my new employer understands.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"As soon as the LUZ flight ban lifts. Even after the LUZ is gone, shuttles will take a while to start up again. But my new employer understands.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4525.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38663","byteOffset":28961240,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_E2874951","articyId":"72057645577613179","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"I will. I'm... excited. I'm half-packed already, and I have a list of things I want to get when I arrive on Luna. Including noodles.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I will. I'm... excited. I'm half-packed already, and I have a list of things I want to get when I arrive on Luna. Including noodles.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":5125.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47251","byteOffset":32211744,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_308FCE47","articyId":"72057645577613194","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sanna Sinamon","text":"The best. And I'll miss them. And you. Take care, ok. I'll send you a postcard. Luna! I can't wait.","speakerId":"Ntt_F70051FC","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The best. And I'll miss them. And you. Take care, ok. I'll send you a postcard. Luna! I can't wait.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5725.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26608","byteOffset":17946264,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_8D033B85","articyId":"72057645577612879","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Hi Sanna.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hi Sanna.","TextSheVersion":"Hi Sanna.","TextTheyVersion":"Hi Sanna."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":925.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47039","byteOffset":32127416,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_71799D38","articyId":"72057645577613012","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sure.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure.","TextSheVersion":"Sure.","TextTheyVersion":"Sure."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1525.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30728","byteOffset":19505216,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_9E3B8939","articyId":"72057645577613044","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Are you sure you're doing the right thing?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Are you sure you're doing the right thing?","TextSheVersion":"Are you sure you're doing the right thing?","TextTheyVersion":"Are you sure you're doing the right thing?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2425.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36863","byteOffset":28289520,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_49EB1AB1","articyId":"72057645577613051","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","